    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "90 Kerrymount is a beautifully presented 2 bedroom, 2 bathroom, first floor apartment. The property offers well-proportioned accommodation throughout, comprising two generous double bedrooms, both with built-in wardrobes, and a bright open-plan kitchen and living area. The master bedroom features a stylish en suite shower room, upgraded in recent years, while the main family bathroom has also been tastefully renovated.\n\nOccupying a desirable corner position, the apartment benefits from an attractive porthole-style window, providing additional natural light and ventilation. There is excellent storage throughout, including a hot press and separate storage room as well as fitted wardrobes.\n\nThe apartment further benefits from two private balconies, with access from both the bedroom and living area. These provide lovely, peaceful views over the surrounding mature grounds and offer an ideal space to relax and enjoy the tranquil setting.\n\nAdditional features include lift access and secure underground parking. The property is surrounded by beautifully landscaped and mature communal gardens, creating a peaceful and welcoming environment.\nApartment 90 Kerrymount is ideally located with easy access to the LUAS, as well as a wide selection of local shops, amenities and transport links.\n\nKilgobbin Wood enjoys an exceptionally convenient and highly sought-after location, with a wealth of amenities and excellent transport links close by. Leopardstown Shopping Centre is within easy walking distance, while Dundrum Town Centre, Carrickmines Retail Park, Stepaside Village and Sandyford Village are all just a short drive away. The area is also well served by a range of major employment and business hubs, including Sandyford and Cherrywood Business Parks, as well as Beacon Hospital and Beacon South Quarter. Families are particularly well catered for, with an excellent selection of primary and secondary schools in the surrounding area. Nearby schools include Holy Trinity, Gaelscoil Sliabh Rua, Gaelscoil Thaobh na Coille and Our Lady of the Wayside, along with secondary schools including Rosemont, Educate Together, St. Benildus, Loreto Foxrock and St. Raphaela`s. For commuters, transport options are excellent, with the Luas Green Line at The Gallops providing convenient access to Dublin city centre and beyond. The development also offers easy access to both the M50 and N11, making this an ideal location for those travelling throughout Dublin and further afield.\n\n\nDisclaimer\n\nThe above particulars are issued by Mark Kelly & Associates (MKA) on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through them. Information contained in the brochure does not form any part of any offer or contract and is provided in good faith, for guidance only. MKA have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. Maps and plans are not to scale and measurements are approximate, photographs provided for guidance only. The particulars, descriptions, dimensions, references to condition, permissions or licenses for use or occupation, access and any other details, such as prices, rents or any other outgoings are for guidance only and may be subject to change. Intending purchasers / tenants must satisfy themselves as to the accuracy of details provided to them either verbally or as part of this brochure. Neither MKA or any of its employees have any authority to make or give any representation or warranty in respect of this property.\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
